@ShopAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5235
# Paste the accessToken returned by Login here:
@token =

### Register a customer
POST {{ShopAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/Register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "personName": "Test Customer",
  "phoneNumber": "0912345678",
  "address": "Damascus - Example Street",
  "password": "ChangeMe123"
}

### Login (the refresh token is returned as an HttpOnly cookie)
POST {{ShopAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/Login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "0912345678",
  "password": "ChangeMe123"
}

### Public catalog
GET {{ShopAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Product/active

### Create an order (requires login)
POST {{ShopAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Order
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: checkout-demo-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### Health
GET {{ShopAPI_HostAddress}}/health/ready
